  "Description": [
    "manipulating geometric shapes with spherical geometry s2geometry is for manipulating geometric shapes. Unlike many geometry libraries, S2 is primarily designed to work with spherical geometry, i.e., shapes drawn on a sphere rather than on a planar 2D map.  This makes it especially suitable for working with geographic data."
